{"book":"transformations","bookTitle":"Transformations, symmetry and position","concept":8,"title":"Enlargements and reductions","grades":"Grades 8–9","goal":"I can enlarge and reduce shapes with a scale factor.","teach":"An <b>enlargement</b> changes the size but keeps the shape and the angles. Every length is multiplied by the <b>scale factor</b> k. If k &gt; 1 the image is bigger; if 0 &lt; k &lt; 1 it is smaller (a reduction). With the origin as centre, (x; y) → (kx; ky). The area is multiplied by k².","tvis":"<div class=\"vis\"><span class=\"vi\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:385px;height:auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 296 204\"><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"24\" y2=\"24\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"24\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"24\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"102\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"102\" y2=\"24\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"128\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"128\" y2=\"24\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"154\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"154\" y2=\"24\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"24\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"206\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"206\" y2=\"24\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"232\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"232\" y2=\"24\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"258\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"24\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"154\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"128\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"102\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"102\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"76\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"50\